<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1864] Cannot configure jndiNames for CacheJndiTmLookup </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1864</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Since user have an ability to configure only lookup class name via org.apache.ignite.configuration.TransactionConfiguration#getTxManagerLookupClassName, he lacks ability to properly configure all of its properties.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This seems to be a general problem for this approach&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12910741">IGNITE-1864</key>
            <summary>Cannot configure jndiNames for CacheJndiTmLookup </summary>
